research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f6-examples.log-5918-items/thm-a-locally-compact-hausdorff-space-is-completely-regular.md:4:title: "Under dependent choice a locally compact Hausdorff space is completely regular, hence Tychonoff"
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f6-examples.log-5919-items/thm-laurent-cauchy-complete.md:4:title: "Every Cauchy sequence in $\\mathbb{R}((t^{-1}))$ converges: $K$ is sequentially Cauchy complete"
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f6-examples.log-5920-items/thm-laurent-ordered-field.md:4:title: "$\\mathbb{R}((t^{-1}))$ is an ordered field, ordered by the sign of the leading coefficient"
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f6-examples.log-5921-items/thm-positive-heredity-of-separation-axioms.md:4:title: "$T_0$, $T_1$, $T_2$, regularity, $T_3$, complete regularity, and Tychonoffness are hereditary"
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f6-examples.log-5922-items/thm-metric-compactness-equivalences.md:4:title: "For a metric space, compact, countably compact, limit point compact, sequentially compact, and complete together with totally bounded are all equivalent, given countable choice and dependent choice"
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f6-examples.log:5923:items/thm-complete-and-totally-bounded-uniform-spaces-are-compact.md:4:title: "Assuming the ultrafilter lemma, every complete and totally bounded uniform space is compact"
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f6-examples.log-5924-items/thm-metric-completion-unique.md:4:title: "A completion is unique up to a unique isometry fixing the original space, and uniformly continuous maps into complete spaces extend through it"
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f6-examples.log-5925-items/thm-completely-regular-implies-regular.md:4:title: "Every completely regular space is regular, and every Tychonoff space is $T_3$"
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f6-examples.log-5926-items/thm-rat-ordered-field.md:4:title: "The rationals form a totally ordered field"
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f6-examples.log-5927-items/thm-metric-spaces-are-completely-normal.md:4:title: "In a metric space any two separated sets have disjoint open neighbourhoods, so every metrizable space is completely normal"
research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-refuter-refute-f6-examples.log-5928-items/thm-reals-cauchy-complete.md:4:title: "The reals are complete"
